<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Agile in Practice on Fujitsu Agile Development Guide</title><link>https://onebase-fujitsu.github.io/agile-dev-guide/en/docs/practice/</link><description>Recent content in Agile in Practice on Fujitsu Agile Development Guide</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en</language><atom:link href="https://onebase-fujitsu.github.io/agile-dev-guide/en/docs/practice/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Day 1</title><link>https://onebase-fujitsu.github.io/agile-dev-guide/en/docs/practice/day1/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://onebase-fujitsu.github.io/agile-dev-guide/en/docs/practice/day1/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="day-1"&gt;&#10; Day 1&#10; &lt;a class="anchor" href="#day-1"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="application-requirements"&gt;&#10; Application Requirements&#10; &lt;a class="anchor" href="#application-requirements"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Let&amp;rsquo;s get started and build a working application with agile development.&#10;This time, we will build a task management app as a simple example.&#10;It is hard to say what exactly makes a hands-on exercise like this &amp;ldquo;agile development,&amp;rdquo;&#10;but we will proceed without doing a rigid design up front, adding the features we need as we go.&#10;Read on as if a new Story that adds a feature is added at each step.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Day 2</title><link>https://onebase-fujitsu.github.io/agile-dev-guide/en/docs/practice/day2/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://onebase-fujitsu.github.io/agile-dev-guide/en/docs/practice/day2/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="day-2"&gt;&#10; Day 2&#10; &lt;a class="anchor" href="#day-2"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;On Day 2, we will have the client send HTTP requests to the server, and then do the initial setup of the server and try building a simple API.&#10;Things get considerably harder from here, but let&amp;rsquo;s keep going.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="testing-and-implementing-asynchronous-communication"&gt;&#10; Testing and Implementing Asynchronous Communication&#10; &lt;a class="anchor" href="#testing-and-implementing-asynchronous-communication"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&#10;&lt;h3 id="testing-asynchronous-communication"&gt;&#10; Testing Asynchronous Communication&#10; &lt;a class="anchor" href="#testing-asynchronous-communication"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h3&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;First, let&amp;rsquo;s build a feature that fetches the task list when the top screen opens and displays the fetched tasks.&#10;Web browsers have a feature called the &lt;a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/ja/docs/Web/API/Fetch_API"&gt;Fetch API&lt;/a&gt;&#10;.&#10;By calling the Fetch API from React, you can fetch resources from a specified URL.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Day 3</title><link>https://onebase-fujitsu.github.io/agile-dev-guide/en/docs/practice/day3/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://onebase-fujitsu.github.io/agile-dev-guide/en/docs/practice/day3/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="day-3"&gt;&#10; Day 3&#10; &lt;a class="anchor" href="#day-3"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;By the end of Day 2, we had a frontend that requests the task list from the server and renders the task list on screen based on the response.&#10;However, there is still no backend that responds to those requests, so let&amp;rsquo;s build it.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="initial-backend-setup"&gt;&#10; Initial Backend Setup&#10; &lt;a class="anchor" href="#initial-backend-setup"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&#10;&lt;h3 id="creating-the-spring-boot-project"&gt;&#10; Creating the Spring Boot Project&#10; &lt;a class="anchor" href="#creating-the-spring-boot-project"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h3&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;The easiest way to create a Spring Boot project is to select Spring Boot from IntelliJ&amp;rsquo;s &amp;ldquo;New Project&amp;rdquo; wizard.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Day 4</title><link>https://onebase-fujitsu.github.io/agile-dev-guide/en/docs/practice/day4/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://onebase-fujitsu.github.io/agile-dev-guide/en/docs/practice/day4/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="day-4"&gt;&#10; Day 4&#10; &lt;a class="anchor" href="#day-4"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;By the end of Day 3, we were able to connect the frontend built with React to the backend built with Spring Boot.&#10;However, although we can display tasks, there is still no feature for adding tasks.&#10;From Day 4 on, let&amp;rsquo;s keep adding features.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="building-the-add-task-screen"&gt;&#10; Building the Add Task Screen&#10; &lt;a class="anchor" href="#building-the-add-task-screen"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Right now, the Client application does not have a router yet.&#10;For example, accessing &lt;a href="http://localhost:5173/"&gt;http://localhost:5173/&lt;/a&gt;&#10; shows the Home screen,&#10;and accessing &lt;a href="http://localhost:5173/hogehoge"&gt;http://localhost:5173/hogehoge&lt;/a&gt;&#10; also shows the Home screen.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Day 5</title><link>https://onebase-fujitsu.github.io/agile-dev-guide/en/docs/practice/day5/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://onebase-fujitsu.github.io/agile-dev-guide/en/docs/practice/day5/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="day-5"&gt;&#10; Day 5&#10; &lt;a class="anchor" href="#day-5"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Now let&amp;rsquo;s create the backend API that creates a Todo.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="task-creation-backend-api"&gt;&#10; Task Creation Backend API&#10; &lt;a class="anchor" href="#task-creation-backend-api"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&#10;&lt;h3 id="tests"&gt;&#10; Tests&#10; &lt;a class="anchor" href="#tests"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h3&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;First, let&amp;rsquo;s write a server test.&#10;We will write a test that sends a request to &lt;code&gt;POST /todos&lt;/code&gt; with JSON set in the body and checks the response code and response data.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-kotlin" data-lang="kotlin"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;// TodoControllerTest.kt&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;package&lt;/span&gt; com.fujitsu.todoappserver.controller&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;import&lt;/span&gt; com.fasterxml.jackson.module.kotlin.jacksonObjectMapper&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;import&lt;/span&gt; com.fasterxml.jackson.module.kotlin.readValue&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;import&lt;/span&gt; com.fujitsu.todoappserver.model.Todo&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;import&lt;/span&gt; org.assertj.core.api.Assertions.assertThat&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;import&lt;/span&gt; org.json.JSONObject&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;import&lt;/span&gt; org.junit.jupiter.api.Test&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;import&lt;/span&gt; org.springframework.beans.factory.annotation.Autowired&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;import&lt;/span&gt; org.springframework.boot.test.context.SpringBootTest&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;import&lt;/span&gt; org.springframework.boot.test.web.client.TestRestTemplate&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;import&lt;/span&gt; org.springframework.http.*&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;@SpringBootTest&lt;/span&gt;(webEnvironment = &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;SpringBootTest&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;WebEnvironment&lt;/span&gt;.RANDOM_PORT)&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;class&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;TodoControllerTest&lt;/span&gt; {&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;@Autowired&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;lateinit&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;var&lt;/span&gt; restTemplate: TestRestTemplate&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;@Test&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;fun&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;タスク一覧を取得できる&lt;/span&gt;() {&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;val&lt;/span&gt; header = HttpHeaders()&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; header.contentType = &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;MediaType&lt;/span&gt;.APPLICATION_JSON&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;val&lt;/span&gt; response = restTemplate.exchange(&lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;/todos&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;HttpMethod&lt;/span&gt;.GET, HttpEntity(&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;null&lt;/span&gt;, header), String&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;::&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;class&lt;/span&gt;.java)&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;val&lt;/span&gt; mapper = jacksonObjectMapper()&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;val&lt;/span&gt; articles: List&amp;lt;Todo&amp;gt; = mapper.readValue(response.body&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;!!&lt;/span&gt;)&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; assertThat(response.statusCode).isEqualTo(&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;HttpStatus&lt;/span&gt;.OK)&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; assertThat(articles.size).isEqualTo(&lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;0&lt;/span&gt;)&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; }&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;@Test&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;fun&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;タスクを新規作成できる&lt;/span&gt;() {&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;val&lt;/span&gt; newTodoJson = JSONObject()&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; newTodoJson.put(&lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;title&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;test title&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;)&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;val&lt;/span&gt; header = HttpHeaders()&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; header.contentType = &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;MediaType&lt;/span&gt;.APPLICATION_JSON&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;val&lt;/span&gt; postResponse = restTemplate.exchange(&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;/todos&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;,&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;HttpMethod&lt;/span&gt;.POST,&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; HttpEntity(newTodoJson.toString(), header),&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; String&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;::&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;class&lt;/span&gt;.java&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; )&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;val&lt;/span&gt; mapper = jacksonObjectMapper()&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;val&lt;/span&gt; todo: Todo = mapper.readValue(postResponse.body&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;!!&lt;/span&gt;)&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; assertThat(postResponse.statusCode).isEqualTo(&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;HttpStatus&lt;/span&gt;.CREATED)&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; assertThat(todo.id).isEqualTo(&lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;1&lt;/span&gt;)&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; assertThat(todo.title).isEqualTo(&lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;test title&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;)&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; assertThat(todo.completed).isEqualTo(&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;false&lt;/span&gt;)&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; }&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;}&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;This is equivalent to the &lt;code&gt;Get /Todos&lt;/code&gt; test we wrote the other day, so it should be fine.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Day 6</title><link>https://onebase-fujitsu.github.io/agile-dev-guide/en/docs/practice/day6/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://onebase-fujitsu.github.io/agile-dev-guide/en/docs/practice/day6/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="day-6"&gt;&#10; Day 6&#10; &lt;a class="anchor" href="#day-6"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Now that the client and server work together to create tasks, let&amp;rsquo;s write scenario tests.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="setting-up-the-e2e-test-environment"&gt;&#10; Setting Up the E2E Test Environment&#10; &lt;a class="anchor" href="#setting-up-the-e2e-test-environment"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;First, let&amp;rsquo;s create an environment for E2E tests.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-shell" data-lang="shell"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;mkdir e2e&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;cd e2e&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;mkdir test&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;touch test/test.js &#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;npm init&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;When you run the &lt;code&gt;npm init&lt;/code&gt; command, a setup dialog appears. For now, just press Enter for everything without setting anything, and create package.json.&#10;Then install testcafe, an E2E testing library.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>